    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good way to put it. the 'surrender' part really hits home. i guess i'm struggling because it's getting hard to separate him from how i've been feeling lately. it's like when i'm writing his thoughts, i'm just writing mine. it feels so heavy, like there's no light at the end of the tunnel for him, or for me. do you think the story even needs a happy ending? or would that just feel fake?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
